=====Usage notes=====
{{m|ur|ترکی|tr=turkī}} is the most common way to refer to the [[w:Turkey|Republic of Turkey]]. However, the [[w:Government of Pakistan|Government of Pakistan]] has started using {{m|ur|تُرْکِیَہ}} more frequently upon the change of the official English name to the [[Republic of Türkiye]], with an alternative spelling of {{m|ur|ترکیے|tr=turkīye}}.

